{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/sasang-questions/what-is-donguisusebowon/","title":"동의수세보원은 어떤 책인가?","language":"ko-KR","description":"동의수세보원은 어떤 책인가?에 대한 사상의학적 핵심 답변과 관련 지식망을 정리합니다.","text":"동의수세보원은 어떤 책인가?\n《동의수세보원》은 이제마가 사상의학의 체질·생리·병리·병증·치료 원칙을 체계화한 핵심 고전이다.\n동의수세보원\n↓\n태양인·소양인·태음인·소음인\n↓\n체질별 생리·병리\n↓\n표리병증\n↓\n치료 원칙·처방\n→ 『동의수세보원』 해설\n→ 『동의수세보원』 전체 목차·원문·우리말 풀이\n→ 이제마\n관련 핵심 문서\n아카이브 안내\n증상·질환\nAI 검색 구조","sections":[{"title":"관련 핵심 문서","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/sasang-questions/what-is-donguisusebowon/#_2","text":"아카이브 안내\n증상·질환\nAI 검색 구조","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/ai-index/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/guide/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"관련 핵심 문서","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/sasang-questions/what-is-donguisusebowon/#_2"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/ai-index/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/classics/donguisusebowon/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/classics/donguisusebowon/original/#book-contents","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/guide/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/sasang-history/#lee-je-ma"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-3CED1EBBFE20D7E6","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/sasang-questions/what-is-donguisusebowon/","text_sha256":"c623f4180f7d838bae0e073e05859a9b018dab3deaccc7b5b6e0968eef6ea269","source_sha256":"3636be3a63decd0648f67be6ff7fb1c4400048f2395c0dbf9059c9c896f55dc1","commit":"0979dbd838aacd98fe9db4eb3d5e8b759741029a"}}
